# 🎓 Academic Intelligence Pipeline

      A real-time student analytics pipeline built using **Apache Kafka**, **Snowflake**, and **Python**.  
      This project fetches student data from university APIs, streams the data through Kafka, and stores it in Snowflake for centralized analytics.

---

# 🚀 Project Architecture

      University API
            ↓
      Kafka Producer
            ↓
      Kafka Topic (student_topic)
            ↓
      Kafka Consumer
            ↓
      Snowflake Database

📌 Features
    Real-time API data streaming
    Kafka-based message pipeline
    Snowflake centralized database
    Student academic analytics
    Scalable data integration architecture

🛠️ Technologies Used
    Python
    Apache Kafka
    Snowflake
    Requests Library
    Kafka-Python
    Snowflake Connector

📂 Project Files
    producer.py
    consumer.py
    README.md

🔗 API Used
    College Student Data API
    https://info.aec.edu.in/adityaapi/api/studentdata/{roll_no}

⚙️ Kafka Setup
    Start Kafka Server
    cd C:\kafka\bin\windows
    
    kafka-server-start.bat ../../config/server.properties
    Create Kafka Topic
    kafka-topics.bat --create --topic student_topic --bootstrap-server localhost:9092
    Verify Topic
    kafka-topics.bat --list --bootstrap-server localhost:9092

🗄️ Snowflake Setup
    Create Database
    CREATE DATABASE academic_intelligence;
    Use Database
    USE DATABASE academic_intelligence;
    Create Table
    CREATE TABLE students (
        studentname STRING,
        rollno STRING,
        branch STRING,
        overallpercent FLOAT,
        mobilenumber STRING
    );

📦 Install Required Libraries
    pip install kafka-python
    pip install snowflake-connector-python
    pip install requests

📤 Producer Script
   The producer fetches student data from the API and sends it to Kafka.

   Run Producer
   python producer.py

  Example Input:
  Enter Roll Number:
  22A91A05K7

Example Output:
  ✅ Data sent to Kafka successfully

📥 Consumer Script

    The consumer reads Kafka messages and inserts data into Snowflake.
    Run Consumer
    python consumer.py

Example Output:

   Waiting for Kafka data...

   ✅ Data inserted into Snowflake

📊 Verify Data in Snowflake
    Run:
    SELECT * FROM students;

🎯 Workflow
    • User enters student roll number
    • Producer fetches API data
    • Kafka streams data through topic
    • Kafka streams data through topic
    • Consumer receives Kafka messages
    • Snowflake stores centralized student data

